abstract: Tools for spatial analysis, raster processing, and geospatial data access.
  Includes functions for GDAL/OpenDroneMap command building, GeoServer WFS downloads,
  STAC catalog queries, spatial joins, and raster operations. Extracted from the ngr
  package's ngr_spk_* function family.
